{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20521","headline":"送枝江刘明府 · 张籍","name":"送枝江刘明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老着青衫爲楚宰，平生志业有谁知。\n家僮从去愁行远，县吏迎来怪到迟。\n定访玉泉幽院宿，应过碧涧早茶时。\n向南渐渐云山好，一路唯闻唱竹枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}